# APK builds. On the production box these are ~213MB of untracked binaries sitting
# in the web app's public/ directory, and every image build copied them in. They
# are never served from there: both nginx sites alias /downloads/ to the host
# directory /opt/doergo/infra/docker/downloads/, which holds the newer APK that
# is actually offered for download. Excluding them takes ~213MB off the image
# and the build context without changing what any visitor can reach.
apps/web-app/public/downloads/
